                "title": "Clear Scalloped Glass Knob With Beaded Rose, Fusion 19-B6",
                "description": "Clear Glass Knob With Beaded Rose Fusion 19-B6 - Beautifully cut, like a diamond, the Scalloped Clear Glass Knob is made even more so with the addition of the classically styled beaded Rose. Available in 4 finishes, this Scalloped Clear Knob is a great way to add elegant allure to any home. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
